# Local development needs no secrets and no .env file: the app is same-origin, and
# `npm run dev` proxies /api to the local PocketBase on 127.0.0.1:8090.
#
# Never commit a real .env (.gitignore covers .env and .env.*). Prod and staging secrets
# live only on those machines (docs/ops.md).

# Set by GitHub Actions; `npm run build` writes it to pb_public/build.json as "sha".
# Leave it unset locally and the sha is "dev".
# GITHUB_SHA=
